@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = customer-mahesh
@conversationId = conv-return-policy

### ===================================================================
### STANDARD CHAT ENDPOINT VERIFICATION
### The application also exposes a non-RAG chat endpoint. These requests
### verify that endpoint and its conversation memory independently from RAG.
### ===================================================================

### Query : Standard Chat — General Customer Support
### Expected: A normal assistant response without policy retrieval augmentation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q1",
  "message": "Please greet me and tell me how you can help with my SwiftKart order."
}

###

### Query 2: Standard Chat — Conversation Continuity
### Expected: Uses the same standard-chat conversation history from Query 12.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-standard-chat",
  "message": "What did I ask you about in my previous message?"
}

###

### Query 3: Standard Chat — Generated Conversation ID
### Expected: A successful response containing a generated conversationId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "message": "Give me a brief order-support greeting."
}

###

### ===================================================================
### REQUEST VALIDATION VERIFICATION
### Both chat controllers reject a blank or missing userId with HTTP 400.
### ===================================================================

### Query 4: RAG Chat — Missing Required userId
### Expected: HTTP 400 with 'userId must not be blank'.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-missing-user-rag",
  "message": "What is the return policy?"
}

###

### Query 5: Standard Chat — Blank Required userId
### Expected: HTTP 400 with 'userId must not be blank'.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-blank-user-standard",
  "message": "Can you help me with an order?"
}
